      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EPH",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "Therefore don’t be partakers with them.",
      "ko": "그러므로 저희와 함께 참예하는 자 되지 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "14bc7ce62f96773d65b2796a9849cb28a9667cfe768a4d1e035b23844dfec7a2",
      "translation_text_hash": "bdaa7761b10f856b15aec867b9a4059310c2e3ef33f8ac3777a8795dfec83166",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
